  <main_text>
    <l n="1">morati decretum Concilii Con-</l>
    <l n="2">stantiensis, longè supra Conci-</l>
    <l n="3">lium Papam extulerunt: quid?</l>
    <l n="4">quod Martinus Quintus post</l>
    <l n="5">missionem Patrum, non se gessit</l>
    <l n="6">ut virum mancipatum</l>
    <l n="7">dictatui illorum, aut ullius Synodi,</l>
    <l n="8">cum scribens ad Imperatorem</l>
    <l n="9">Constantinopolitanum se vocat</l>
    <l n="10">arbitrum imperii cælestis, Chri-</l>
    <l n="11">stum Domini, Dominum uni-</l>
    <l n="12">versi orbis, Patrem Regum,</l>
    <l n="13">Lumen mundi.</l>
    <l n="14" para="true">Certè usque adeo hoc seculo,</l>
    <l n="15">hinc Papale imperium erat ro-</l>
    <l n="16">bore validum, illinc verò exigua</l>
    <l n="17">authoritas erat Concilii,aut Con-</l>
    <l n="18">stantiensis, aut Basiliensis, subji-</l>
    <l n="19">cientis Papam Concilio; Basiliensis</l>
    <l n="20">imprimis Eugenium exaucto-</l>
    <l n="21">rantis, &amp; in ejus locum Ame-</l>
    <l n="22">deum qui se Felicem V. vocavit,</l>
    <l n="23">substituentis; ut non solum nemo</l>
